---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { SOCIAL } from '../consts'
---

<Base
  title="Bio"
  description="Betim Drenica — software architect, building Sent. Previously .NET and mobile, and a founder of the Albanian .NET and SQL Server user groups in Prishtina."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Bio</h1>

    <p>
      I'm Betim Drenica. I build software, and occasionally write about it here.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm currently building <a href={SOCIAL.sent} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sent</a>,
      a messaging API. Before that I spent years as a software architect working across
      backend services, APIs, and mobile — mostly in the .NET world, with detours through
      iOS and Android.
    </p>

    <p>
      Earlier on I was involved in the developer community in Prishtina: helping run ALNUG
      and ALSSUG, the Albanian .NET and SQL Server user groups, and speaking at conferences
      around Kosovo. A good part of the older writing on this site comes from that period,
      and a fair amount of it is in Albanian.
    </p>

    <p>
      This site is mostly an archive plus whatever I'm thinking about now. Posts go back to
      2011. The early ones are about technology that no longer exists, which I've left up
      rather than quietly deleted.
    </p>

    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Twitter — <a href={SOCIAL.x} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{SOCIAL.xHandle}</a></li>
      <li>GitHub — <a href={SOCIAL.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">betimd</a></li>
      <li>LinkedIn — <a href={SOCIAL.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">in/betim</a></li>
      <li>Sent — <a href={SOCIAL.sent} target="_blank" rel="noopener">sent.dm</a></li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      If you want to reach me, the <a href="/contact.html">contact page</a> is the fastest way.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
